abstract: >-
  A Dual-Lane Epistemic Harness (DLEH) that separates epistemic authorization from candidate
  generation for generative AI systems under evidence gaps, grounded in the Toledo Readout Bridge.
  This repository holds the preprint (v3), an independent reconstruction of the paper's finite-state
  conformance checker, and a corrections log found during pre-deposit review.
